539	/// openai-python `ChatCompletionStream`: a chunk whose `object` is not `chat.completion.chunk`
540	/// is skipped (`_is_valid_chat_completion_chunk_weak`); the first chunk becomes the snapshot by
541	/// ASSIGNING `choices[choice.index]`; later choices are looked up by LIST POSITION
542	/// (`choices[choice.index]`, appending on IndexError); deltas merge by `accumulate_delta`; then
543	/// `message.tool_calls[tool_call_chunk.index]` is read for every fragment, outside the try.
